<p><strong>Departure points:</strong> Capt. Pruner's inshore trips leave from Ruskin, at 611 Destiny Drive. Offshore and crappie trips launch from a ramp chosen for the day. Your captain confirms the meeting point when you book. See <a href="/tampa-bay-fishing/">where we fish</a> and <a href="/faq/">common questions</a>.</p>
<form name="contact" method="POST" action="/thank-you/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company">
  <p hidden><label>Leave blank <input name="company"></label></p>
  <label for="f-name">Name</label><input id="f-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
  <label for="f-email">Email</label><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email">
  <label for="f-phone">Phone</label><input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel">
  <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="sms_consent" value="yes"> By checking this box, you agree to receive text messages from Charter Fishing Tampa Bay about your inquiry and booking. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out. [CONFIRM wording matches A2P registration]</label>
  <label for="f-trip">Trip you want</label>
  <select id="f-trip" name="trip"><option>Inshore</option><option>Nearshore</option><option>Offshore</option><option>Crappie</option><option>Redfish</option><option>Snook</option><option>Tarpon</option><option>Grouper</option><option>Shark</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select>
  <label for="f-date">Date</label><input id="f-date" name="date" type="date">
  <label for="f-guests">Number of guests</label><input id="f-guests" name="guests" type="number" min="1">
  <label for="f-msg">Message</label><textarea id="f-msg" name="message" rows="5"></textarea>
  <p><button class="btn btn-accent" type="submit">Send message</button></p>
</form>
